<title>FINLAND: Raisio says sells processing tech business.</title>
<headline>Raisio says sells processing tech business.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food, feed and chemicals group Raision Yhtyma said on Thursday that its engineering unit had sold its processing technology business to a new company in which Raisio Engineering will have a minority stake.</p>
<p>Annual net sales of the processing technology business are about 30 million markka, Raisio said in a statement. The unit's operations focus on the planning and implementation of starch and potato processing facilities.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
